00:53:27.020 --> 00:53:30.120
And Stanley comes in, and he's like, you better put it.
斯坦利进来了，他说，你们最好把它放好。

1283
00:53:30.140 --> 00:53:31.960
And they're like, ah, bah, bah, bah, bah, bah, bah, bah, bah.
他们就说，啊，吧，吧，吧，吧，吧，吧，吧，吧。

1284
00:53:31.960 --> 00:53:36.700
And Phyllis is like, they've accepted our gesture of treats and nothing more.
菲利斯说，他们只接受了我们的点心，别的什么都没接受。

1285
00:53:36.880 --> 00:53:37.980
Something like that.
差不多是这样。

1286
00:53:38.080 --> 00:53:40.020
I can't remember exactly, but it's really good.
我记不太清了，但真的很精彩。

1287
00:53:41.160 --> 00:53:45.980
We had a fan catch from Bethy in Ohio at 19 minutes and 36 seconds.
我们收到了一位来自俄亥俄州的粉丝贝茜的反馈，在19分36秒处。

1288
00:53:46.180 --> 00:53:51.620
It looks like Phyllis briefly breaks character after Kevin's line, when we walked in here,
看起来菲利斯在凯文说出那句台词后短暂地出戏了，当时我们走进来，

