00:53:51.780 --> 00:53:54.300
we were all prepared to tell you to go to hell.
我们都准备好让你们滚蛋了。

1290
00:53:54.820 --> 00:54:00.560
Well, Beth, I looked at this, and I don't think Phyllis is breaking.
嗯，贝茜，我看了这段，我觉得菲利斯没有出戏。

1291
00:54:01.440 --> 00:54:04.120
When y'all rewatch it, check it out.
你们重看的时候，可以留意一下。

1292
00:54:04.560 --> 00:54:05.880
Let us know what you think.
让我们知道你们怎么看。

1293
00:54:06.000 --> 00:54:10.840
But I think Phyllis is just smiling because she's pleased with herself.
但我认为菲利斯只是在微笑，因为她对自己很满意。

1294
00:54:11.080 --> 00:54:11.280
Mm.
嗯。

1295
00:54:12.020 --> 00:54:14.320
Michael and Dwight were turned triumphant.
迈克尔和德怀特凯旋而归。

1296
